<title>HUNGARY: Hungary net foreign debt drops to $11.77bln in May.</title>
<headline>Hungary net foreign debt drops to $11.77bln in May.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's net foreign debt dropped to $11.77 billion in May from $12.2 billion in April, the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Friday.</p>
</text>
